# Reddit API Credentials (Required for Reddit scraping)
# Get these from https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps
REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=your_reddit_client_id_here
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=your_reddit_client_secret_here
REDDIT_USER_AGENT=your_app_name (by your_username)

# Note: Only Reddit API credentials are required.
# Other news sources (Livemint, Economic Times, Google News) use web scraping
# and don't require any API keys.
